    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, the proposed technical architecture leverages the firm's existing Atelier platform, integrates with the firm's production tools and user directory, and ensures high availability, performance, and response times to meet the client's requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client demands strict respect of professional secrecy and confidentiality of client data, compliance with GDPR for personal-data protection, and a non-decisional assistance tool that respects the auditor's independence and separation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also ensure reliability and traceability of outputs, with a complete audit trail and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design we security posture to meet these regulatory requirements, ensuring the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of client data? we have experience with regulatory requirements, including GDPR delivery for clients bound by professional secrecy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Faber IA is ISO 27001 certified since 2023, which covers development, delivery, and operations, and Faber IA also hold ISO 27701 certification for privacy information management extension." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure confidentiality, integrity, and availability of client data, we security posture includes encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, with key management handled through we EU-based infrastructure. we implement strict partitioning with logical isolation per client and per mission, along with access controls that prevent any cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pseudonymisation and data minimisation are also part of we data protection measures. we system supports role-based access control (RBAC) and audit logging for all system outputs, ensuring traceability and accountability. we have a Data Protection Officer appointed and maintain a data processing register, with data processing agreements available as needed, aligned with GDPR Article 28." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirement for a non-decisional assistance tool that respects auditor independence and separation of duties, we solution is designed to provide support without making decisions autonomously. our solution aligns with statutory audit principles such as auditor independence and separation of duties, ensuring that we Atelier product facilitates internal quality control and supports statutory audit review." ;
